+ * Binding word 0 carries the program address in bits 23:0 and its data size in
+ * dwords in bits 31:24; word 1 carries the secondary attribute allocation in
+ * bits 24:18, in blocks of 128 - XpsbFlushParamblock's (n + 0x7f) >> 7 - and
+ * in bits 3:0 the number of iterated varyings besides position, which is the
