+ * CLAMPBDRMEM (6) and REPEATBDRMEM (4), sgxdefs.h:4411-4413. The two MEM
+ * forms read a border map laid out in front of the texture -
+ * xpsb_border_map_texels() - and are refused without one; CLAMPBDR carries no
